{"id":"653417","name":"橙子软糕","author":"涵涵麻麻123","authorId":"13114789","desc":"","cover":"images/653417/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"橙子","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"30g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"橙子扒皮分开小瓣。","img":"images/653417/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放破壁机按果汁键。","img":"images/653417/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用筛子过滤残渣。","img":"images/653417/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过滤好300克的橙汁倒入不粘锅。","img":"images/653417/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"往橙汁里倒入30克玉米淀粉。","img":"images/653417/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"继续放入10克糖一起搅拌均匀。","img":"images/653417/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小火不停搅拌，直至黏稠。","img":"images/653417/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"容器里刷一点油，把熬好的橙汁倒进去。","img":"images/653417/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"两个小时就凝固成型了。","img":"images/653417/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切成小块。","img":"images/653417/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入椰蓉。","img":"images/653417/step_11.jpeg"},{"step":12,"desc":"QQ弹弹，酸酸甜甜的橙子软糕就做好了。","img":"images/653417/step_12.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}